cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GBIF Alert, please cite it as below. Development of GBIF Alert has
  been supported by the European Union's Horizon Europe research and innovation
  programme under grant agreements No 101181413 (GuardIAS) and No 101180559
  (OneSTOP), and previously by LIFE RIPARIAS.
title: GBIF Alert
abstract: >-
  GBIF Alert is a reusable, open-source early alert system for invasive species,
  built on GBIF occurrence data. A single instance monitors a configurable set of
  species over a configurable area, and notifies its users by email when new
  occurrences are published on GBIF. It is deployed as several independent
  instances by different organisations.
type: software
